# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/chain_hollowstar.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event hs_dreams_begin
# en: The Black Star Dream
title [c0e94a] = 黑星之梦
# en: You dream of the lake from underneath. There is a round door at the bottom, and above the water a star that is not a light but an absence. A voice says your name like it is tasting it. You wake with frost on your pillow.
text [aadef3] = 你梦见从水下仰望湖面。湖底有一扇圆门，水面之上有一颗星——它不是光，而是一种缺失。一个声音念出你的名字，像在品尝它。你醒来时，枕头上结着霜。
# en: A dreamscape: a frozen lake seen from beneath, a round door glowing at the bottom, and above it a star that is a hole in the sky.
scene [ba146d] = 梦境：从水下仰望结冰的湖面，湖底一扇发光的圆门，上方一颗如同天空破洞的星。
# en: Write the dream down
opt.left.label [f34e00] = 把梦记下来
# en: Your notes fill four pages. In the morning you don't remember writing the last line: "It is not asleep. It is waiting."
opt.left.say.1 [5620a5] = 你的笔记写满了四页。早上，你不记得自己写过最后一行：“它没有沉睡。它在等待。”
# en: Ask Seraphine what it means
opt.right.label [37112a] = 问瑟拉芬这是什么意思
# en: Seraphine listens, then hands you a sprig of lavender. "It won't stop the dreams," she says. "But it'll make them smell nicer."
opt.right.say.1 [2b221e] = 瑟拉芬听完，递给你一枝薰衣草。“它止不住那些梦，”她说，“但能让梦闻起来香一点。”

@event hs_grey_stranger
# en: A Man in Grey
title [52d66e] = 灰衣人
# en: The courtyard fountain freezes mid-splash with a crack like a whip. Kael, who never raises his voice, is shouting at a tall man in a grey coat: "Tell her no. I did." The man smiles. "The door under the lake will be opened, by you or by your sister. Your mother doesn't mind which." Then he turns his head and says your name, which nobody told him.
text [4b0834] = 庭院的喷泉在溅起的一瞬间冻住了，发出鞭子抽响般的一声脆响。从不提高嗓门的凯尔，正冲着一个穿灰外套的高个子男人大吼：“告诉她不。我已经说过了。”那男人笑了。“湖底的门会被打开，由你，或者由你妹妹。你母亲并不在乎是谁。”然后他转过头，叫出了你的名字，而从来没有人告诉过他。
# en: A frozen fountain in a moonlit courtyard; a tall man in a grey coat facing a pale young man who is shouting, frost spreading from both.
scene [57e116] = 月光下庭院里一座冻住的喷泉；一个穿灰外套的高个子男人面对一个正在大吼的苍白年轻人，霜从两人身上蔓延开来。
# en: Back into the shadows
opt.left.label [c90bea] = 退回阴影里
# en: You back away. He looks at the exact spot where you're hiding, smiles, and walks out through the gate with frost blooming in his footprints. You don't sleep. Neither, you suspect, does Kael.
opt.left.say.1 [1003f6] = 你往后退。他看着你藏身的那个位置，分毫不差，笑了笑，走出大门，霜在他的脚印里开花。你一夜没睡。你猜凯尔也没有。
# en: Step out beside Kael
opt.right.label [23ee9c] = 站到凯尔身边
# en: He'll remember your face.
opt.right.hint [3fb718] = 他会记住你的脸。
# en: "He said no." It comes out louder than you meant. The man in grey studies you, inclines his head and leaves; the cold he leaves behind bites through your sleeves. Kael's hands are shaking. "You shouldn't have done that," he says. "...Thank you."
opt.right.say.1 [0f8ac0] = “他说了不。”你的声音比你想的大。灰衣人打量着你，点了点头，走了；他留下的寒气咬透了你的袖子。凯尔的手在发抖。“你不该那么做的，”他说，“……谢谢。”

@event hs_founders_records
# en: The Founders' Ledger
title [92688a] = 创始者账簿
# en: In the archive vault you find the Founders' Ledger, three hundred years old. The entry for the academy's founding year has been cut out with a razor. But the page beneath still holds the impression of the pen.
text [8885d9] = 你在档案库里找到了三百年前的《创始者账簿》。记载学院创立那一年的条目被人用刀片割掉了。但下面那一页上，仍留着笔尖的压痕。
# en: A dusty archive vault, a giant ledger open on a lectern, one page carefully razored out.
scene [f6e330] = 积满灰尘的档案库，讲台上摊开一本巨大的账簿，其中一页被小心地割掉了。
# en: Leave it — this feels dangerous
opt.left.label [7ed54a] = 算了——这感觉很危险
# en: You close the ledger. The dust settles. Some doors are better left alone. Probably.
opt.left.say.1 [cce53b] = 你合上账簿。灰尘落定。有些门最好别去碰。大概吧。
# en: Rub charcoal over the page
opt.right.label [3eeead] = 用炭笔拓印那一页
# en: Ghostly letters emerge: "Seven towers, seven locks. The Star sleeps beneath the water. The key is a star that holds no light." The founders built the academy as a seal.
opt.right.say.1 [8ceb50] = 幽灵般的字迹浮现出来：“七塔七锁。星眠于水下。钥匙是一颗不盛光的星。”创始者建起这座学院，正是为了作一道封印。
# en: The impression is too faint. You make out only three words: "...beneath the water..."
opt.right.say.2 [bee5f6] = 压痕太浅了。你只辨认出四个字：“……于水下……”

@event hs_restricted_founders
# en: The Chained Drafts
title [872dc4] = 锁链里的草稿
# en: The archive's ledger has its founding page cut out. The Restricted Section keeps the founders' own drafts, chained to a shelf at the very back, and the chain is warm to the touch. Somewhere behind you, a book turns its own page.
text [c28920] = 档案库那本账簿里建校的那一页被割掉了。禁书区里藏着创始者们亲笔的草稿，用锁链锁在最里面的书架上，那锁链摸上去是温的。你身后某处，一本书自己翻了一页。
# en: A dark aisle of the Restricted Section at midnight, a bundle of yellowed drafts chained to a shelf, the chain faintly glowing.
scene [1a2ec0] = 午夜禁书区一条昏暗的过道，一捆发黄的草稿被锁链锁在书架上，锁链隐隐发光。
# en: Work the chain loose
opt.left.label [aa3f60] = 把锁链弄松
# en: The links give one by one, and burn your fingers doing it. The drafts say it plainly, in three hands: "Seven towers, seven locks. The Star sleeps beneath the water. The key is a star that holds no light." Lumenhold is a seal.
opt.left.say.1 [9baf12] = 链环一节一节松开，烫伤了你的手指。草稿上用三种笔迹写得明明白白：“七座塔，七把锁。星沉睡于水下。钥匙是一颗不含光的星。”流明堡就是一道封印。
# en: The chain shrieks like a ward. You're out of the window before the prefect arrives, but not before he sees your face. Detention, and a long look from the librarian.
opt.left.say.2 [c540d6] = 锁链像护界一样尖叫起来。你在级长赶到前翻出了窗，但他还是看见了你的脸。禁闭，外加图书管理员长长的一眼。
# en: Copy the shelf-list instead
opt.right.label [e5a618] = 改抄书目清单
# en: The drafts' shelf-list is less guarded and nearly as strange. One entry reads only "Key: the seventh tower, top room. Do not lend." You copy it out by the light of a reading charm you have to keep alive for an hour, and it leaves you drained.
opt.right.say.1 [ba1ef3] = 草稿的书目清单看守得没那么严，却几乎一样古怪。其中一条只写着：“钥匙：第七塔，顶层。不外借。”你借着一道得撑上一个钟头的阅读咒的光把它抄下来，抄完人都虚脱了。

@event hs_boathouse_bell
# en: The Hatch in the Boathouse
title [333304] = 船屋里的活板门
# en: Under a coil of rotten rope in the boathouse there's a hatch, and under the hatch, stone steps going down into the lake. The air coming up smells of cold bronze. From somewhere below, very faint, a bell is tolling under the water.
text [d8dbb2] = 船屋里一卷烂绳子底下有一扇活板门，门下是通往湖里的石阶。往上涌的空气带着冰冷的青铜味。下面某处，非常微弱，一口钟正在水底鸣响。
# en: The inside of an old wooden boathouse at night, a square hatch open in the floorboards, stone steps leading down into dark water.
scene [947bde] = 夜里一座旧木船屋的内部，地板上一扇方形活板门敞开着，石阶通向漆黑的水里。
# en: Go down the steps
opt.left.label [26f409] = 走下台阶
# en: The steps become a tunnel under the lakebed, dry and ice-cold, running toward the sound. You follow it until you can see the bell's green rim in the dark ahead. Then you turn back, frozen to the bone, and remember every turning.
opt.left.say.1 [1ef535] = 台阶变成了湖床下的一条隧道，干燥而冰冷，朝着钟声延伸。你一直走到能看见前方黑暗中那口钟青绿的边沿。然后你转身往回走，冻得透骨，每一个拐弯都记在心里。
# en: The third step is ice. You go into the water to the chest and come up gasping, but you've seen it: a tunnel under the lake, running toward the bell. You walk home soaked.
opt.left.say.2 [c6b05c] = 第三级台阶结了冰。你一下子掉进齐胸深的水里，喘着气爬出来，但你看见了：湖底有条隧道，通向那口钟。你湿淋淋地走回了家。
# en: Listen at the waterline
opt.right.label [8f90c9] = 在水边倾听
# en: You lie on the boards with your ear to the gap. The bell tolls seven times, slow, and between the strokes you hear a draught moving under the lake, the way air moves in a corridor. Something down there is a door. You don't sleep well.
opt.right.say.1 [0754e3] = 你趴在木板上，耳朵贴着缝隙。钟慢慢地敲了七下，在两响之间，你听见湖底有气流在移动，就像空气在走廊里流动那样。下面有一扇门。你一夜没睡好。

@event hs_seraphine_shadow
# en: One Star Too Many
title [bd51fe] = 多出来的一颗星
# en: Seraphine has turned the great telescope down, not at the sky but at the lake, where the stars are reflected. "Look," she says. "In the water. There's one star too many, and it's dark." She counts under her breath. "It wasn't there in my dream. It was in yours."
text [f656d5] = 瑟拉芬把那架大望远镜往下转，没对着天空，而是对着倒映着星星的湖面。“看，”她说，“水里。多了一颗星，而且是暗的。”她低声数着。“我的梦里没有它。是你的梦里有。”
# en: An observatory at night, the great telescope tilted down toward the window and the lake below, a seer pointing at the reflection of the stars in the water.
scene [93fed0] = 夜里的观星台，大望远镜朝下对着窗外的湖，一位预言者指着水中星星的倒影。
# en: Chart it with her
opt.left.label [c4492b] = 和她一起绘出它的位置
# en: You chart it till dawn on the cold floor: a small dark shape in the reflection that has no star above it, sitting exactly over the middle of the lake. Your knees never quite forgive you.
opt.left.say.1 [ff1233] = 你们在冰冷的地板上一直画到天亮：倒影里有一个小小的暗影，上方的天空里却没有对应的星，它正好停在湖的正中央。你的膝盖再也没完全原谅你。
# en: Tell her about your dream
opt.right.label [cc1d2c] = 告诉她你的梦
# en: She finishes your sentences, three of them, before you've started them. Then she shows you the dark star in the water, right over the middle of the lake. You both stop talking for a long time.
opt.right.say.1 [167dc3] = 你还没开口，她就替你说完了三句话。然后她指给你看水中那颗暗星，正在湖心上方。你们俩很久都没再说话。

@event hs_kael_truth
# en: What Kael Is Running From
title [5fe24d] = 凯尔在逃避什么
# en: It comes to a head on the observatory roof. You've had a year of his silences and you tell him so, loudly. He shouts back, for the first time ever: "My family serve the thing under this lake! They sent me here to open its door!" Frost races out from his boots across the roof. Then, quieter: "I came to stop them. Some nights I'm not sure which I'll do."
text [ec30b4] = 事情在观星台屋顶上爆发了。你受够了他一整年的沉默，大声告诉了他。他第一次吼了回来：“我的家族侍奉这湖底下的东西！他们派我来这里打开它的门！”霜从他的靴子底下飞窜过整个屋顶。然后，声音低了下去：“我来是为了阻止他们。有些夜里，我不确定自己会做哪一件。”
# en: Two students on an observatory roof at night, one shouting with frost racing out from his boots across the leads, the other standing their ground.
scene [ec8aff] = 夜里观星台屋顶上的两个学生，一个在大吼，霜从他靴底飞窜过铅皮屋顶，另一个寸步不让。
# en: "Then we stop them together."
opt.left.label [72f262] = “那我们一起阻止他们。”
# en: He looks at you for a long moment, and the frost on the roof melts a little. "Together," he repeats, as if trying out a word from another language.
opt.left.say.1 [80bf53] = 他看了你很久，屋顶上的霜化了一点。“一起。”他重复道，像在试一个外语单词。
# en: Tell the headmistress
opt.right.label [bcf093] = 告诉院长
# en: The headmistress thanks you gravely. The next day Kael is moved to a room in the headmistress's tower. He doesn't look at you anymore.
opt.right.say.1 [07e3f1] = 院长郑重地感谢了你。第二天，凯尔被搬进了院长塔楼里的一个房间。他再也不看你了。

@event hs_star_mark
# en: The Cold Coin Burns
title [2ace55] = 冰冷的硬币在灼烧
# en: The black-starred relic you've been carrying burns suddenly, so cold it feels hot. When you drop it, there's a pale star-shaped mark on your palm. It hums when you're near the lake.
text [32d3ff] = 你一直带在身上的那件黑星遗物突然灼烧起来，冷到像是滚烫。你把它扔下时，掌心多了一枚苍白的星形印记。靠近湖边时，它会嗡嗡作响。
# en: A student's open palm, a pale star-shaped mark glowing on it, a blackened coin smoking on the floor beside them.
scene [be9e03] = 一个学生摊开的掌心，上面闪着苍白的星形印记，一枚发黑的硬币在旁边的地上冒着烟。
# en: Throw the relic into the lake
opt.left.label [9e07e3] = 把遗物扔进湖里
# en: It sinks without a ripple. The mark on your hand fades — almost entirely. Something under the water sighs.
opt.left.say.1 [f57ba3] = 它沉了下去，没起一丝涟漪。你手上的印记褪去了——几乎完全褪去。水下有什么东西叹了口气。
# en: Keep it. Feel the power.
opt.right.label [9c18f9] = 留着它。感受这份力量。
# en: The mark pulses with every heartbeat. Spells come easier now. Much easier. That should probably worry you more than it does.
opt.right.say.1 [49d379] = 印记随着每一次心跳搏动。现在施法容易多了。容易太多了。这本该比现在更让你担心才对。

@event hs_grey_offer
# en: An Offer in Grey
title [72fb9a] = 灰色的提议
# en: Every candle in the room goes blue at once. The man in grey is sitting at your table, uninvited, a black velvet box open in front of him. "You've been asking about the Star," he says. "It has started asking about you. It could make you extraordinary. All it wants is a door opened." He turns the box toward you. Inside it you see yourself, burning.
text [92c6d3] = 屋里的每一支蜡烛同时变成了蓝色。灰衣人不请自来，坐在你的桌边，面前打开着一个黑丝绒盒子。“你一直在打听那颗星，”他说，“它也开始打听你了。它能让你非凡。它要的只是一扇门被打开。”他把盒子转向你。盒子里，你看见了自己，在燃烧。
# en: A grey-coated man sitting uninvited at a library table, a black velvet box open in front of him, every candle around him burning blue.
scene [ed2d17] = 一个穿灰外套的男人不请自来地坐在图书馆桌边，面前打开着一个黑丝绒盒子，他周围的每一支蜡烛都燃着蓝火。
# en: "Get out."
opt.left.label [f967c3] = “滚出去。”
# en: He leaves. He remembers.
opt.left.hint [7103e7] = 他会走。他会记得。
# en: He inclines his head and leaves. The candles go back to yellow. You realise your hands are trembling, and that he looked at you on the way out the way a man looks at a lock.
opt.left.say.1 [462c88] = 他点了点头，走了。蜡烛变回了黄色。你这才发觉自己的手在发抖，而他离开时看你的眼神，就像一个人在看一把锁。
# en: "...What would it give me?"
opt.right.label [d466af] = “……它能给我什么？”
# en: Everything, a little. The nights turn cold.
opt.right.hint [40ed04] = 一切都会好一点。夜会变冷。
# en: He shows you, just for a moment. Power, endless and cold, in everything you can do at once. When he's gone you can still taste it, and that night you dream of water closing over your head.
opt.right.say.1 [f32dee] = 他给你看了，只有一瞬间。力量，无穷无尽，冰冷彻骨，同时流进你会做的每一件事。他走后，你仍能尝到那股滋味；那天夜里，你梦见水在头顶合拢。

@event hs_grey_return
# en: A Small Service
title [225de0] = 小小的差事
# en: {flag(hollow_tempted): The man in grey is on a bench in the winter garden, and the fountain beside him has frozen mid-splash. "You liked what you tasted," he says. "Here is how it continues." He holds out a sealed letter. "Leave this under the third plank of the boathouse jetty. Nothing more."|The man in grey is on a bench in the winter garden, and the fountain beside him has frozen mid-splash. "You told me to get out," he says, pleasantly. "I did. Now a small thing, and I'll stay out." He holds out a sealed letter. "The third plank of the boathouse jetty. Nothing more."}
text [d954a1] = {flag(hollow_tempted): 灰衣人坐在冬日花园的长椅上，他身旁的喷泉在半空中冻住了。“你喜欢那滋味，”他说，“接下来是这样。”他递出一封封好的信。“把它放在船屋栈桥第三块木板底下。仅此而已。”|灰衣人坐在冬日花园的长椅上，他身旁的喷泉在半空中冻住了。“你叫我滚出去，”他和颜悦色地说，“我滚了。现在只是件小事，办完我就不再来。”他递出一封封好的信。“船屋栈桥，第三块木板。仅此而已。”}
# en: A grey-coated man on a frozen garden bench, a sealed letter held out between two gloved fingers, the fountain beside him iced over.
scene [ecc098] = 一个穿灰外套的男人坐在结冰的花园长椅上，两根戴手套的手指夹着一封封好的信，身旁的喷泉结满了冰。
# en: Take the letter to the jetty
opt.left.label [935473] = 把信送到栈桥
# en: Hollow. He pays in what he promised.
opt.left.hint [89d3bb] = 空洞。他会兑现承诺。
# en: You do it at midnight, with the lake breathing under the planks. In the morning there's a purse on your pillow and the cold dreams are back, sweeter than before.
opt.left.say.1 [cdaade] = 你在午夜去办了，湖水在木板下呼吸。第二天早上，枕头上放着一只钱袋，冰冷的梦又回来了，比以前更甜美。
# en: Drop it in the fountain unread
opt.right.label [c6d2c0] = 把信丢进喷泉
# en: Lumen. He won't thank you.
opt.right.hint [032137] = 流明。他不会感谢你。
# en: You break the ice and push the letter under. The ink runs blue. He watches it sink, then you, and then he isn't there, and the fountain starts to splash again as if nothing had happened.
opt.right.say.1 [573f87] = 你敲开冰面，把信按了下去。墨水洇成了蓝色。他看着信沉下去，又看着你，然后他就不在了，喷泉重新溅起水花，好像什么都没发生过。

@event hs_grey_invitation
# en: A Seat at the Northern Table
title [c52641] = 北境之席
# en: There is a letter on your pillow, sealed with a black star. The handwriting is beautiful. "The families have watched you with great interest," it says. "There is a seat for you at our table, when the door is opened. Come to the boathouse at midnight, or burn this. Either is an answer."
text [13f2ac] = 你的枕头上放着一封信，用一枚黑色的星封着蜡。字迹很漂亮。“世家怀着极大的兴趣关注着你，”信上写道，“门打开之时，我们的席上会有你一个座位。午夜到船屋来，或者烧了这封信。两者都是答复。”
# en: A black-edged letter on a dormitory pillow, its wax seal pressed with a star that has no light in it.
scene [f56301] = 宿舍枕头上一封镶黑边的信，封蜡上压着一颗不发光的星。
# en: Go to the boathouse
opt.left.label [526aa1] = 去船屋
# en: The man in grey is waiting with two cups of something hot. He talks to you as an equal for an hour. You come back with frost in your hair and the feeling of having been measured, and found to fit.
opt.left.say.1 [c84e12] = 灰衣人端着两杯热饮在等你。他像对待平辈一样和你谈了一个小时。你回来时头发上沾着霜，觉得自己被丈量过，而且尺寸正合适。
# en: Burn it
opt.right.label [162285] = 烧掉它
# en: The paper burns blue and slow, and smells of the lake. It takes a long time to go out. Climbing back from where you've been is slower still, but this is a step.
opt.right.say.1 [dfcc08] = 信纸燃起蓝色的火，烧得很慢，散发着湖水的气味。它很久才烧尽。从你走到的地方爬回来还要更慢，但这是一步。

@event hs_grey_tests
# en: The Good Argument
title [e22d78] = 好听的道理
# en: The man in grey falls into step beside you outside the infirmary. "You help people," he says pleasantly. "I admire it. But think how many more you could help with real power. The Star doesn't care what it's used for. Only that someone uses it."
text [9adfef] = 灰衣人在医务室外与你并肩而行。“你帮助别人，”他和气地说，“我很欣赏。可想想看，若有真正的力量，你能多帮多少人。星不在乎它被用来做什么，只在乎有人用它。”
# en: A grey-coated man standing beside a student at the infirmary window, both looking down at a first-year with a bandaged arm.
scene [86ebbc] = 一个穿灰外套的男人和一名学生并肩站在医务室窗前，一起低头看着一个手臂缠着绷带的一年级生。
# en: "No."
opt.left.label [371a7a] = “不。”
# en: "No," you say. He smiles as if you'd said something charming, and leaves. The first-year in the window waves at you. You wave back, and your hand is shaking.
opt.left.say.1 [ce8c7e] = “不，”你说。他笑了笑，仿佛你说了句讨人喜欢的话，然后离开了。窗边的一年级生朝你挥手。你也挥手，手在发抖。
# en: "...How many more?"
opt.right.label [faa864] = “……能多帮多少？”
# en: He tells you. The numbers are very large and very cold. That night, you dream of the lake from underneath, and you are not frightened in the dream.
opt.right.say.1 [3239c8] = 他告诉了你。那些数字非常大，也非常冷。那天夜里，你梦见从湖底往上看，而梦里的你并不害怕。

@event hs_wardens_notice
# en: The Headmistress Takes Note
title [f7baa8] = 院长记下了你
# en: On the grand stair the headmistress stops beside you. "Several people have told me about you," she says, "and not one of them was complaining. That is rare." Her silver ring catches the light. "I keep a list of students I would trust with a door. Don't let it go to your head."
text [aef554] = 在大楼梯上，院长在你身旁停下。“好几个人跟我提起过你，”她说，“没有一个是来告状的。这很少见。”她的银戒指映着光。“我有一份名单，上面是我愿意托付一扇门的学生。别因此得意忘形。”
# en: A tall woman in dark robes pausing on a stair to look down at one student among many, a silver ring glinting on her hand.
scene [25a5bf] = 一位身着深色长袍的高个女人在楼梯上停步，低头看着众多学生中的一个，手上的银戒指闪着光。
# en: "I'd be honoured."
opt.left.label [bec864] = “我深感荣幸。”
# en: "Good," she says. "Honour is a heavy thing to carry. Practise." She walks on. You stand on the stair for some time.
opt.left.say.1 [e74b53] = “很好，”她说，“荣誉是件沉重的东西。多练练。”她继续往前走。你在楼梯上站了好一会儿。
# en: "What kind of door?"
opt.right.label [ee5679] = “什么样的门？”
# en: Her short, delighted laugh. "The kind that ought to stay shut," she says. "Keep asking questions like that. Just not on the stairs."
opt.right.say.1 [c568f6] = 她发出那声短促而愉快的笑。“应该一直关着的那种，”她说，“继续问这样的问题吧。只是别在楼梯上问。”

@event hs_seventh_tower
# en: The Seventh Tower
title [44b8dc] = 第七塔
# en: The seventh tower has been locked for a century, and its wards start shrieking the moment you touch the door. You go up anyway, two steps at a time, while lights come on all over the academy. At the very top, a single room: dust, moonlight, and a star-shaped hollow in the wall, holding something that does not reflect any light.
text [e14416] = 第七塔已经锁了一百年，你一碰门，它的结界就尖叫起来。你还是上去了，一步跨两级，整个学院的灯一盏盏亮起。在塔顶只有一个房间：灰尘，月光，墙上一个星形的凹槽，里面放着一样不反射任何光的东西。
# en: The top of a narrow, abandoned tower, cobwebbed and moonlit, with a wall bearing a star-shaped recess.
scene [c775ba] = 一座狭窄废塔的顶层，蛛网密布，月光洒入，墙上有一个星形凹槽。
# en: Take it quietly
opt.left.label [2a0b10] = 悄悄拿走
# en: A key shaped like a star, black as a hole in the world. As you lift it, every candle in the academy goes out for one breath. You walk back in the dark with it cold against your ribs, and you don't sleep.
opt.left.say.1 [f9b295] = 一把星形的钥匙，黑得像世界上的一个洞。你拿起它的一刻，学院里每一支蜡烛都熄灭了一口气的工夫。你揣着它在黑暗中走回去，它冰冷地贴着你的肋骨，你一夜没睡。
# en: A ward shrieks. A prefect finds you on the stairs. You get detention and a very long look from the headmistress.
opt.left.say.2 [ca0973] = 防护咒尖叫起来。一位级长在楼梯上逮住了你。你被关了禁闭，还挨了院长很长很长的一眼。
# en: Take it boldly
opt.right.label [f86c9d] = 强行拿走
# en: You tear through the ward with brute force, and it drains you to the bone. The key comes free. Every candle in the academy goes out for one breath, and somewhere below, a door hears it.
opt.right.say.1 [777369] = 你凭蛮力撕开了护界，这把你耗得精疲力尽。钥匙脱落下来。学院里每一支蜡烛都熄灭了一口气的工夫，而在下面某处，一扇门听见了。
# en: The ward throws you down two flights of stairs.
opt.right.say.2 [1014e6] = 防护咒把你甩下了两层楼梯。

@event hs_key_breakfast
# en: Something of Mine
title [f9fe6f] = 我的东西
# en: At breakfast the headmistress sets down her cup and looks straight at you along the whole length of the hall. Afterwards she is waiting at the door. "Every candle in my academy went out," she says pleasantly, "and you have something of mine."
text [e0137d] = 早餐时，校长放下杯子，隔着整个大厅直直地看着你。之后她在门口等你。“我学院里的每一支蜡烛都灭了，”她愉快地说，“而你拿着我的一样东西。”
# en: The high table at breakfast, the headmistress setting down her cup and looking along the hall at one student, the candles behind her newly lit.
scene [fdadd9] = 早餐时的高桌，校长放下杯子，沿着大厅望向一名学生，她身后的蜡烛刚刚重新点亮。
# en: Give her the key
opt.left.label [28b877] = 把钥匙交给她
# en: She takes it in a gloved hand without looking at it. "Thank you. It will be where it is needed, on the night. So, I hope, will you." You feel lighter, and a little robbed.
opt.left.say.1 [86a9c7] = 她用戴手套的手接过去，看都没看一眼。“谢谢。那一夜，它会在需要它的地方。我希望你也会。”你觉得轻松了些，又有点像被抢了。
# en: Keep it
opt.right.label [87c2f5] = 留着它
# en: A long pause. "Then keep it close," she says, "and never let it near the water before its time. People will come asking for it. Not all of them will ask." From then on, the man in grey always seems to know where you are.
opt.right.say.1 [d35dc1] = 长长的停顿。“那就贴身收好，”她说，“时候未到，绝不要让它靠近湖水。会有人来讨要它。不是每个人都会开口讨。”从那以后，灰衣人似乎总知道你在哪儿。

@event hs_isolde_summons
# en: The Headmistress Knows
title [214bdc] = 院长知道了
# en: The headmistress summons you to her tower. Thorne is there, and Maud, and on the desk between them is a letter with a black-star seal, opened. "The Dumonts' mother is coming south for the Blossom moon," Isolde says. "She means to open the door herself. I need people I trust beneath the lake. Or you may walk away, and no one in this room will blame you."
text [840fcc] = 院长召你去她的塔。索恩在，莫德也在，他们之间的桌上放着一封拆开的黑星封蜡信。“杜蒙夫人要在花潮之月南下，”伊索尔德说，“她打算亲手打开那扇门。我需要我信得过的人到湖底去。你也可以离开，这个房间里没有人会怪你。”
# en: A circular study at the top of a tower, walls lined with sleeping portraits, the headmistress standing by a window over the lake, Thorne and Maud beside her, a black-sealed letter on the desk.
scene [9c23a6] = 一座塔顶的圆形书房，墙上挂满沉睡的肖像，院长站在俯瞰湖面的窗前，索恩和莫德在她身旁，桌上放着一封黑色封蜡的信。
# en: Walk away
opt.left.label [96da1a] = 离开
# en: "Wise," she says, and you can't tell if she means it. Maud looks at her tea. "Then stay above," says the headmistress, "and keep the first-years indoors."
opt.left.say.1 [617954] = “明智。”她说，你分辨不出她是不是真心的。莫德看着自己的茶。“那就留在上面，”院长说，“让一年级生待在屋里。”
# en: "I'll be there."
opt.right.label [d06338] = “我会去的。”
# en: She presses a silver ward-ring into your hand. "{flag(star_key): The founders' key is with you. Keep it close.|{flag(gave_star_key) or flag(key_taken): The founders' key is in my desk; the Wardens saw to that.|The founders' key is kept at the top of the seventh tower.}} On the night, it comes down with us. Learn quickly. You have until Blossomtide."
opt.right.say.1 [4f7604] = 她把一枚银色的护界戒指按进你手里。“{flag(star_key): 创始者的钥匙在你身上。带好它。|{flag(gave_star_key) or flag(key_taken): 创始者的钥匙在我桌子里；守望者们办妥了。|创始者的钥匙存放在第七塔的顶上。}}那一夜，它要随我们一起下去。学快点。你只有到花潮月的时间。”

@event hs_the_night
# en: The Night the Lake Froze
title [6f7fcc] = 湖面冰封之夜
# en: In the middle of spring, the lake freezes in a single breath, from shore to shore. Cracks glow beneath the ice. Every candle in the academy leans toward the water. Out on the ice, lanterns are moving in a ring: someone is already there. Under it all the bell is tolling, {clue(lake_bell): the note you followed once|a note you've never heard and somehow know}.
text [1c4991] = 春天正盛，湖却在一口气间冻住了，从这岸到那岸。冰下的裂缝发着光。学院里的每一支蜡烛都朝水面倾斜。冰上有一圈提灯在移动：已经有人在那里了。在这一切之下，钟在鸣响，{clue(lake_bell): 那是你曾追寻过的音|那是你从没听过、却莫名认得的音}。
# en: The whole lake frozen white in the middle of spring, cracks glowing from beneath, a ring of lanterns out on the ice, students crowding the towers' windows.
scene [8ddb0d] = 整片湖在春天里冻得雪白，冰下的裂缝发着光，冰面上一圈提灯，学生们挤在塔楼窗前。
# en: Go down beneath the lake
opt.left.label [983634] = 潜入湖底
# en: You run for the boathouse. Behind you, someone is shouting your name. You don't stop.
opt.left.say.1 [28f348] = 你朝船屋奔去。身后有人在喊你的名字。你没有停下。
# en: Stay above and protect the students
opt.right.label [3d4500] = 留在上面保护学生
# en: You hold the doors of the first-year tower all night against things made of frost and whispers. By dawn the lake thaws. Something below is still asleep, for now, and forty children are alive who might not have been.
opt.right.say.1 [477de2] = 你守着一年级塔的门，整夜抵挡那些由霜与低语构成的东西。到黎明，湖解冻了。下面的东西还在沉睡，暂时如此，而四十个本可能活不下来的孩子都活着。

@event hs_tunnel
# en: The Man in the Tunnel
title [809d66] = 隧道里的人
# en: The tunnel runs down under the ice, slick and glowing blue. Halfway down, the man in grey is waiting, alone, as if he has all night. {flag(night_kael): "Kael. Your mother is disappointed." "She always is," says Kael, and the walls frost over.|{flag(night_ilse): "Ilse. You were meant to open it." "I know what I was meant for," she says.|{flag(night_isolde): "Headmistress. You're late by sixty years." "Then I'll be thorough," she says.|"Go back up," he says pleasantly. "This isn't your door."}}}
text [61b72b] = 隧道在冰下一路向下，湿滑，泛着蓝光。走到一半，灰衣人在那里等着，独自一人，好像他有整夜的时间。{flag(night_kael): “凯尔。你母亲很失望。”“她一向如此。”凯尔说，墙壁结满了霜。|{flag(night_ilse): “伊尔泽。你本该打开它的。”“我知道我本该做什么。”她说。|{flag(night_isolde): “院长。你晚了六十年。”“那我就做得彻底些。”她说。|“回上面去吧，”他和颜悦色地说，“这不是你的门。”}}}
# en: A slick stone tunnel under the ice, lit blue from above, a tall man in a grey coat standing in the middle of it with his hands folded.
scene [07762c] = 冰层下一条湿滑的石隧道，上方透下蓝光，一个穿灰大衣的高个男人双手交握，站在隧道中间。
# en: Break through him
opt.fight.label [07b59f] = 从他身上闯过去
# en: Combat. Whoever came down with you fights beside you.
opt.fight.hint [af8914] = 战斗。和你一起下来的人会并肩作战。
# en: You hit him {flag(night_kael): with Kael's frost at the same moment|square}, and he slides back along the ice, {flag(grey_beaten): and this time he isn't surprised; he's angry|surprised for the first time in four years}. He bows, and is simply not there any more. The road down is clear.
opt.fight.say.1 [f664d8] = 你{flag(night_kael): 和凯尔的霜同时|正中}击中了他，他在冰上向后滑去，{flag(grey_beaten): 这一次他没有惊讶，而是动了怒|四年来第一次露出惊讶}。他鞠了一躬，便不在那里了。下去的路畅通了。
# en: He takes your last spell on his own gloved hand and closes his fist on it, then steps back to let you pass, smiling. "Go on, then. She's waiting." You go down bruised, and late.
opt.fight.say.2 [41a7f7] = 他用戴着手套的手接住你最后一道咒语，握拳把它捏碎，然后退后一步让你过去，微笑着。“去吧。她在等你。”你带着一身淤伤下去了，也迟了。
# en: Talk your way past
opt.talk.label [f5bc3b] = 说服他让路
# en: Charm. What the Dumonts were raised for is your best argument.
opt.talk.hint [5818f7] = 魅力。杜蒙家的孩子是为什么被养大的，就是你最好的理由。
# en: You tell him {flag(ilse_taken): that Kael has chosen, and Ilse will|that the Dumont children have chosen, both of them}, and that you know exactly what they were raised for and what it cost them. For a moment he looks old. Then he steps aside. It costs you something, seeing that look.
opt.talk.say.1 [3983ce] = 你告诉他，{flag(ilse_taken): 凯尔已经做了选择，伊尔泽也会|杜蒙家的两个孩子都已经做了选择}，你清清楚楚地知道他们是为什么被养大的，又为此付出了什么。有那么一瞬间，他显得很老。然后他让开了。看见那种神情，你也付出了些什么。
# en: He listens courteously, then tells you, kindly, everything the Dumonts did to their children and why. It takes a long time. He lets you pass only once you've heard every word. You arrive shaken, and late.
opt.talk.say.2 [3f6ed7] = 他礼貌地听完，然后和善地告诉你杜蒙家对他们的孩子做过的一切，以及为什么。说了很久。直到你听完每一个字，他才让你过去。你到达时浑身发抖，也迟了。
# en: Find another way down
opt.slip.label [1e4f9e] = 另找一条路下去
# en: Guile. Easier if you know the old tunnels, or the bell's note.
opt.slip.hint [ab0e75] = 诡计。如果你知道那些旧隧道，或者那口钟的音，会更容易。
# en: You follow the bell's note into a side passage he doesn't know, the one its rope once ran through. You come out below him, breathless, and he never sees you go.
opt.slip.say.1 [7f673b] = 你循着钟声走进一条他不知道的岔道，就是当年钟绳穿过的那条。你从他下方钻出来，气喘吁吁，他始终没看见你走过。
# en: The side passage is half flooded. You come out soaked and freezing below him, and late, and he calls a polite good evening after you down the tunnel.
opt.slip.say.2 [4a074a] = 岔道里一半是水。你从他下方钻出来，浑身湿透冻僵，也迟了，他沿着隧道在你身后礼貌地道了声晚安。

@event hs_threshold
# en: The Founders' Words
title [5a0a8c] = 创始者的咒文
# en: The tunnel ends at a wall of black stone, carved with the founders' words in a script that drifts when you look away, and set with seven round locks, one for each tower. {chosen(hs_maud_locks, right): You know them. Maud told you.|{clue(seven_locks): You know them.|You count them twice.}} Behind it the bell is tolling. {flag(night_maud): Maud lays a hand on the stone and says, "Hello again."|}
text [80135d] = 隧道尽头是一面黑石墙，刻着创始者的话，字迹一移开视线就会漂移，墙上嵌着七把圆锁，每座塔一把。{chosen(hs_maud_locks, right): 你认得它们。莫德告诉过你。|{clue(seven_locks): 你认得它们。|你数了两遍。}}墙后，钟在鸣响。{flag(night_maud): 莫德把一只手按在石头上，说：“又见面了。”|}
# en: A wall of black stone at the end of a tunnel, carved with lines of script that drift when not looked at, seven round locks set in it, a faint bell-tone hanging in the air.
scene [17845a] = 隧道尽头一面黑石墙，刻着不被注视时便会漂移的文字，墙上嵌着七把圆锁，空气里悬着一丝隐约的钟声。
# en: Read the founders' words
opt.read.label [78313a] = 念出创始者的咒文
# en: Lore. Everything you learned about the seal makes it easier.
opt.read.hint [19bc2e] = 学识。你对封印了解的一切都会让它更容易。
# en: {clue(knows_founders_seal): You've read these words before, in pieces.|You've never read them, but they read themselves to you, line by line.} Said whole, they turn the seven locks one after another, and the wall opens like a door. "Seven towers, seven locks," you hear yourself say. "The key is a star that holds no light."
opt.read.say.1 [7b08f2] = {clue(knows_founders_seal): 这些话你以前零零碎碎读过。|你从没读过它们，它们却一行一行自己念给了你。}完整地念出来，它们让七把锁一把接一把转开，墙像门一样打开了。“七座塔，七把锁，”你听见自己说，“钥匙是一颗不发光的星。”
# en: You stumble on the last line, and only six of the locks turn. The wall opens a crack. You squeeze through it, and it takes skin off your shoulder on the way, and the words follow you down the dark like a rhyme.
opt.read.say.2 [fc390d] = 你在最后一行卡住了，只有六把锁转开。墙开了一道缝。你从缝里挤过去，肩膀蹭掉一层皮，那些话像童谣一样在黑暗中一路追着你。
# en: Force the locks
opt.force.label [9bdd4b] = 强行打开锁
# en: Arcana, and it hurts. Maud's wards and Edmund's wand help.
opt.force.hint [1af26a] = 奥术，而且会疼。莫德的护界和埃德蒙的魔杖会有帮助。
# en: {has_item(edmunds_silver_wand): Edmund's wand hums the bell's note against the stone, and the locks turn to it one by one.|You trace the old wards backwards into the stone, {flag(winter_maud): the way Maud showed you|the way the stone seems to want}, and the locks turn one by one.} The wall cracks down the middle and opens. Your hands ache to the elbow.
opt.force.say.1 [479b78] = {has_item(edmunds_silver_wand): 埃德蒙的魔杖贴着石头嗡鸣出那口钟的音，锁一把接一把应声转开。|你{flag(winter_maud): 按莫德教你的那样|顺着石头似乎想要的方向}，把古老的护界反向描进石头里，锁一把接一把转开。}墙从中间裂开，打开了。你的手一直疼到手肘。
# en: The stone fights back. Six locks give; the seventh you break, and it breaks something in your hands too. You get through in the end, raw and shaking.
opt.force.say.2 [4b85cc] = 石头在反抗。六把锁打开了；第七把是你砸开的，它也砸坏了你手里的什么东西。你最后还是过去了，双手血肉模糊，抖个不停。

@event hs_beneath
# en: The Door Beneath the Lake
title [76c2d3] = 湖底之门
# en: Beyond the wall, the round door, open a crack, and through the crack the Hollow Star looks at you. It is beautiful, and it is hungry, and it speaks in your own voice: "You came all this way. Open me. Or take what I'm offering. Or run." {flag(night_kael): Kael is beside you, frost spreading from his feet.|{flag(night_ilse): Ilse is beside you, breathing steady for once.|{flag(night_maud): Maud is beside you{has_item(edmunds_silver_wand): , and Edmund's wand in your hand is humming the bell's note|, humming the bell's note under her breath}.|{flag(night_isolde): The headmistress stands beside you, her ring lit like a lamp.|You are alone.}}}}
text [2a13a3] = 墙后是那扇圆门，开着一道缝，空洞之星透过那道缝看着你。它美丽，它饥饿，它用你自己的声音说话：“你走了这么远。打开我。或者接受我给的东西。或者逃跑。”{flag(night_kael): 凯尔在你身边，霜从他脚下蔓延开来。|{flag(night_ilse): 伊尔泽在你身边，难得地呼吸平稳。|{flag(night_maud): 莫德在你身边{has_item(edmunds_silver_wand): ，你手里埃德蒙的魔杖正嗡鸣着那口钟的音|，低声哼着那口钟的音}。|{flag(night_isolde): 院长站在你身边，她的戒指亮得像一盏灯。|你是一个人。}}}}
# en: A vast domed cavern under the lake, a round door of black stone standing open a crack, and through it a star that is pure absence.
scene [d3244b] = 湖底一座巨大的穹形洞窟，一扇黑石圆门开着一道缝，门后是一颗纯粹由“缺失”构成的星。
# en: Seal the door
opt.seal.label [b5b84d] = 封印这扇门
# en: Needs the star key, the founders' secret or a ward-ring. Arcana; everything you did tonight counts. It can fail.
opt.seal.hint [c5722d] = 需要星钥、创始者的秘密或一枚护界戒指。奥术；你今夜做的一切都算数。可能失败。
# en: {flag(star_key): The star key turns in the round door, and you|{flag(gave_star_key) and flag(night_isolde): The headmistress turns the star key in the round door, and you|You}} speak the founders' words with everything you have, and the door grinds shut. The Star screams without sound. Above you, the ice cracks from shore to shore, and the lake breathes again.
opt.seal.say.1 [bc56ab] = {flag(star_key): 星钥在圆门里转动，你|{flag(gave_star_key) and flag(night_isolde): 院长把星钥插进圆门转动，你|你}}用尽全力念出创始者的话，门轧轧地关上了。星无声地尖叫。在你头顶，冰从这岸裂到那岸，湖又开始呼吸。
# en: Your seal falters. Kael throws every ounce of frost in him into it, and it still isn't enough: the door stays ajar. The last thing you see is the headmistress's lantern coming down the tunnel.
opt.seal.say.2 [69a006] = 你的封印动摇了。凯尔把体内每一分寒冰都押了上去，仍然不够：门依旧半开着。你看见的最后一样东西，是校长的提灯沿着隧道下来。
# en: Your seal falters and breaks, and takes most of you with it. The door stays ajar. The last thing you see is the headmistress's lantern coming down the tunnel.
opt.seal.say.3 [c2675b] = 你的封印动摇、碎裂，几乎带走了你的全部。门依旧半开着。你看见的最后一样东西，是校长的提灯沿着隧道下来。
# en: Accept the Star's bargain
opt.bargain.label [3a1372] = 接受星的交易
# en: Its power, now, and a voice in your head forever. Only for those it has already tempted.
opt.bargain.hint [cbcdc9] = 它的力量，就在此刻，还有一个永远在你脑中的声音。只给那些已经被它诱惑过的人。
# en: You take what it offers, and it feels like coming home. The door closes on its own, for now. The Star settles into the back of your mind like a cat finding a warm lap, and pours itself into your hands.
opt.bargain.say.1 [1871c8] = 你接受了它给的东西，感觉像回到了家。门自己关上了，暂时。星在你脑海深处安顿下来，像一只猫找到了温暖的膝头，然后把自己倾注进你的双手。
# en: You take what it offers. The door closes on its own, for now. The Star settles into the back of your mind like a cat finding a warm lap, and pours itself into your hands, and you can't stop shaking.
opt.bargain.say.2 [0af862] = 你接受了它给的东西。门自己关上了，暂时。星在你脑海深处安顿下来，像一只猫找到了温暖的膝头，然后把自己倾注进你的双手，你止不住地发抖。
# en: Open the door
opt.open.label [6f1706] = 打开这扇门
# en: It wants out. Only one already deep in the Hollow could walk through beside it.
opt.open.hint [55783a] = 它想出来。只有早已深陷空洞的人，才能与它并肩走过这扇门。
# en: You set your palm on the black stone and push. The door swings wide. The Star rises past you like a breath held for three hundred years, and on its way out it touches your shoulder, the way a lord touches a sword. Above, every candle in Lumenhold goes out at once.
opt.open.say.1 [c042d8] = 你把手掌按在黑石上，推开。门大大敞开。星从你身边升起，像一口憋了三百年的气，经过时它碰了碰你的肩，就像领主用剑轻点骑士。在上面，流明堡的每一支蜡烛同时熄灭。
# en: Run
opt.flee.label [57e66a] = 逃跑
# en: You run. You run until the tunnel spits you out onto the shore, and you don't look back once. Behind you, under the ice, the door is still ajar.
opt.flee.say.1 [14a017] = 你跑了。你一直跑到隧道把你吐到岸上，一次也没回头。在你身后，冰下，那扇门还虚掩着。

@event hs_aftermath
# en: After the Thaw
title [a5fec6] = 解冻之后
# en: The lake glitters as if nothing happened. Most of the academy believes there was a strange spring frost. The headmistress knows better. So does Kael, who finds you on the jetty with two cups of tea. {flag(ilse_taken): He doesn't say his sister's name. She went north before dawn, with the man in grey.|{flag(dumont_reunited) and not flag(ilse_went_north): Ilse is further down the jetty, pretending not to watch.|}}
text [092bd4] = 湖面波光粼粼，仿佛什么都没发生过。学院里大多数人以为那只是一场奇怪的春霜。院长知道真相。凯尔也知道——他端着两杯茶，在栈桥上找到了你。{flag(ilse_taken): 他不提妹妹的名字。黎明前，她跟着灰衣人去了北方。|{flag(dumont_reunited) and not flag(ilse_went_north): 伊尔泽在栈桥更远的那头，假装没在看。|}}
# en: The lake glittering in spring sunshine, students skimming stones, a bandaged figure sitting on the jetty.
scene [c9174b] = 春日阳光下波光粼粼的湖面，学生们在打水漂，一个缠着绷带的身影坐在栈桥上。
# en: Sit with him in silence
opt.left.label [ed0b65] = 和他静静坐着
# en: You watch the water. It's just water, now. Kael's tea, for once, doesn't freeze.
opt.left.say.1 [c6b7cf] = 你们看着湖水。现在，它只是水而已。凯尔的茶，难得地没有结冰。
# en: Tell him how you feel
opt.right.label [cb477f] = 告诉他你的心意
# en: He kisses you, and for the first time since you've known him, his hands are warm.
opt.right.say.1 [b9bd38] = 他吻了你。认识他以来第一次，他的手是温暖的。
# en: "I owe you everything," he says. "I'm not good at owing people. I'll learn."
opt.right.say.2 [f06ead] = “我欠你一切，”他说，“我不擅长欠人情。我会学的。”

@event hs_aftermath_lost
# en: The Headmistress Closed It
title [1bb5f9] = 校长关上了它
# en: You wake in the infirmary. The lake has thawed, and the door is shut: the headmistress came down after you and closed it with her own hands. She is sitting by your bed. Her hair has gone white overnight, and her silver ring is gone. {flag(ilse_taken): Ilse went north before dawn.|}
text [29d9e8] = 你在医务室里醒来。湖水已经解冻，门也关上了：院长跟在你后面下去，亲手把它关上了。她就坐在你床边。她的头发一夜之间全白了，那枚银戒指也不见了。{flag(ilse_taken): 黎明前，伊尔泽去了北方。|}
# en: An infirmary bed by a window, the lake thawed outside, a tall woman with newly white hair sitting beside it without her silver ring.
scene [e20e7d] = 窗边的一张医务室病床，窗外湖水已解冻，一个刚刚白了头的高个女人坐在床边，手上没有了银戒指。
# en: "I'm sorry."
opt.left.label [c7fcad] = “对不起。”
# en: "You went down," she says. "Most don't. The door is shut, and I am old, and that was always the price for someone." She pats your hand once, like a chess move. You can't stop thinking about it for weeks.
opt.left.say.1 [a621a0] = “你下去了，”她说，“大多数人不会。门关上了，我老了，这本来就总得有人付出代价。”她拍了一下你的手，像下了一步棋。好几个星期，你都没法不去想这件事。
# en: "What did it cost you?"
opt.right.label [05910a] = “这让你付出了什么？”
# en: She tells you, plainly, and you wish she hadn't. The seal will hold for another lifetime. She won't. She asks you not to tell the others, and you don't, and it weighs on you.
opt.right.say.1 [edb9ba] = 她平静地告诉了你，你却希望她没说。封印能再撑一辈子。她撑不了。她请你别告诉别人，你没说，这件事一直压在你心上。

@event hs_kael_sister
# en: The Sister
title [e9e230] = 妹妹
# en: A girl in white furs is waiting at the gates in a private snowstorm. Kael's younger sister, Ilse. "If my brother won't open it," she says, "I will. Unless you can give me a reason not to."
text [f83d6e] = 一个身穿白色毛皮的女孩等在校门口，一场只属于她的暴风雪围着她下。凯尔的妹妹，伊尔泽。“如果我哥哥不肯打开它，”她说，“我来。除非你能给我一个不这么做的理由。”
# en: A girl in white furs standing at the academy gates in a snowstorm that is falling only on her.
scene [695730] = 一个身穿白色毛皮的女孩站在学院大门前，一场只落在她身上的暴风雪。
# en: Convince her
opt.left.label [089b27] = 说服她
# en: You talk for an hour. Then she's crying, and Kael is holding her, and the snow stops. She stays in the village to be near him.
opt.left.say.1 [43c937] = 你们谈了一个小时。然后她哭了，凯尔抱住了她，雪停了。她留在镇上，好离哥哥近一些。
# en: She listens politely and leaves. "We'll see each other again," she says. "Beneath the water."
opt.left.say.2 [905bac] = 她礼貌地听完，走了。“我们还会再见的，”她说，“在水下。”
# en: Warn the headmistress
opt.right.label [084aca] = 警告院长
# en: Ilse is escorted from the grounds. Kael understands. He says he understands. He's quiet for a long time.
opt.right.say.1 [1fbc19] = 伊尔泽被护送出了校园。凯尔理解。他说他理解。他沉默了很久。
